  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that using scvi_n200 RNA encoder, transformer aggregation, and weighted fusion achieves high performance (config_033: 0.713087). This experiment tests replacing resnet50 with imagenet_vit_l image encoder to isolate the impact of the image encoder choice, which is critical for multimodal models. It directly compares two key design decisions (image encoder) while keeping other components (scvi_n200, transformer, weighted fusion) consistent, providing clear evidence on which image encoder (resnet50 vs imagenet_vit_l) is more effective."
